{"indicator":"ghg-per-capita","unit":"公噸 CO₂e/人","years":[1990,1991,1992,1993,1994,1995,1996,1997,1998,1999,2000,2001,2002,2003,2004,2005,2006,2007,2008,2009,2010,2011,2012,2013,2014,2015,2016,2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023,2024],"notes":{"TWN":"環境部《2026 年中華民國國家溫室氣體排放清冊報告》：2024 年總排放 2.73 億公噸 CO₂ 當量（不含土地利用、土地利用變化及林業），扣除森林等吸收的 2,176 萬公噸後，淨排放 2.51 億公噸。這裡是 2.86 億公噸，多 4.8%：二氧化碳兩邊差不多（Global Carbon Project 2.62 億公噸，清冊 2.62 億公噸），差在 EDGAR 估計的甲烷（1,546 萬公噸，清冊 435 萬公噸）與氧化亞氮（490 萬公噸，清冊 339 萬公噸）。兩邊都用 IPCC AR5 的 GWP-100（化石來源的甲烷 EDGAR 用 30、清冊一律用 28）。","SDN":"含南蘇丹：EDGAR 沒有把它們分開計算，人均用合計的人口；全部溫室氣體也加上南蘇丹的二氧化碳。","ISR":"含巴勒斯坦：EDGAR 沒有把它們分開計算，人均用合計的人口；全部溫室氣體也加上巴勒斯坦的二氧化碳。","SRB":"含蒙特內哥羅與科索沃：EDGAR 沒有把它們分開計算，人均用合計的人口；全部溫室氣體也加上蒙特內哥羅與科索沃的二氧化碳。","CHE":"含列支敦斯登：EDGAR 沒有把它們分開計算，人均用合計的人口；全部溫室氣體也加上列支敦斯登的二氧化碳。","FRA":"含摩納哥：EDGAR 沒有把它們分開計算，人均用合計的人口；全部溫室氣體也加上摩納哥的二氧化碳。","ESP":"含安道爾：EDGAR 沒有把它們分開計算，人均用合計的人口；全部溫室氣體也加上安道爾的二氧化碳。","ITA":"含聖馬利諾與梵蒂岡：EDGAR 沒有把它們分開計算，人均用合計的人口；全部溫室氣體也加上聖馬利諾與梵蒂岡的二氧化碳。"},"notesEn":{"TWN":"Taiwan's Ministry of Environment, 2026 National Greenhouse Gas Inventory Report: total emissions in 2024 were 273.2 Mt CO₂e excluding land use, land-use change and forestry (LULUCF); after 21.8 Mt of removals by forests and other land, net emissions were 251.4 Mt. The figure here is 286.3 Mt, 4.8% higher: CO₂ is nearly the same (Global Carbon Project 262.3 Mt, inventory 261.5 Mt); the gap is EDGAR's methane (15.5 Mt vs 4.3 Mt) and nitrous oxide (4.9 Mt vs 3.4 Mt). Both use IPCC AR5 GWP-100 (EDGAR uses 30 for fossil methane, the inventory 28 throughout).","SDN":"Includes South Sudan, which EDGAR does not report separately; per-person values use the combined population; the all-gas total also adds the CO₂ of South Sudan.","ISR":"Includes Palestine, which EDGAR does not report separately; per-person values use the combined population; the all-gas total also adds the CO₂ of Palestine.","SRB":"Includes Montenegro and Kosovo, which EDGAR does not report separately; per-person values use the combined population; the all-gas total also adds the CO₂ of Montenegro and Kosovo.","CHE":"Includes Liechtenstein, which EDGAR does not report separately; per-person values use the combined population; the all-gas total also adds the CO₂ of Liechtenstein.","FRA":"Includes Monaco, which EDGAR does not report separately; per-person values use the combined population; the all-gas total also adds the CO₂ of Monaco.","ESP":"Includes Andorra, which EDGAR does not report separately; per-person values use the combined population; the all-gas total also adds the CO₂ of Andorra.","ITA":"Includes San Marino and Vatican City, which EDGAR does not report separately; per-person values use the combined population; the all-gas total also adds the CO₂ of San Marino and Vatican City."},"hints":{"TWN":"環境部清冊 2024 年換算：11.77 公噸/人"},"hintsEn":{"TWN":"Taiwan's national inventory, 2024: 11.77 t/person"},"encoding":"delta","aggregates":{"WLD":[-3,6045,-29,-213,-52,-25,43,70,-64,-101,22,49,-47,16,188,110,105,105,70,20,-156,215,124,6,-23,-33,-70,-58,34,61,3,-316,200,63,50,32]},"values":{"CAN":[-3,21833,-541,336,-63,565,355,460,114,71,286,616,-517,-10,321,-331,-416,-259,421,-802,-1455,201,130,-116,53,-179,-268,-570,182,34,-166,-2047,241,213,-196,-510],"GIN":[-3,1008,11,-59,19,40,4,94,-78,34,91,8,13,23,26,24,43,24,19,21,24,152,-19,23,-2,30,29,50,189,-66,46,40,14,49,-57,39],"ROU":[-3,10046,-1874,-586,-496,-92,210,216,-499,-681,-749,211,241,30,289,70,-65,187,290,3,-966,-87,393,-107,-561,21,-25,-22,198,34,-146,-132,238,-247,-309,40],"SRB":[-3,7738,-1808,94,-674,-223,300,671,421,327,-1598,859,423,339,306,559,-391,360,-43,-8,-629,75,334,-602,157,-868,895,233,22,-104,154,240,-150,103,-269,-88],"PRT":[-3,5927,180,425,-167,132,402,-260,281,441,755,-158,-119,396,-508,267,221,-460,-271,-273,-290,-422,-98,-158,-145,29,452,-158,514,-379,-347,-579,-173,2,-305,-195],"MDA":[-3,9587,-1616,-2004,-1277,-702,-260,50,-1077,-266,-418,-282,37,98,102,66,84,65,10,36,-144,227,129,-60,149,6,67,128,163,159,-11,-111,288,-278,80,3